* {{ru-IPA|запу́тать}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|запу́тать|pf|impf=пу́тать,запу́тывать}}

# to [[entangle]], to [[tangle]]
# to [[tangle]], to [[confuse]], to [[complicate]], to [[muddle up]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''запу́тать''' [[де́ло]]|to complicate matters; muddle a business; make a mess of a business; get things into a muddle}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[get]] [[entangled]]/[[enmeshed]] ''(in)''

